knob:
METHOD: In the console run the following one‑liner – it iterates over all interactive elements (`a[href]`, `button`, `[role="button"]`) and logs those whose computed width or height is < 44 px (recommended minimum).
```js
[...document.querySelectorAll('a[href],button,[role="button"]')].forEach(e=>{
const r=e.getBoundingClientRect();
if(r.width<44||r.height<44) console.warn('Small tap target',e,r);
});
```

